# Machine-generated graph payloads. A single graph.json runs to megabytes of
# node ids, so reading one displaces the source it describes from the context
# window; `graphify query` / `path` / `explain` return a scoped subgraph over
# the same data. The deny rules in .claude/settings.json enforce this list.
#
# graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md and graphify-out/wiki/ are deliberately absent:
# they are the human-sized entry points and stay readable.

graphify-out/graph.json
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/manifest.json
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
graphify-out/.graphify_build.json
graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
